{"seq":4,"slug":"diffusion-acceleration","title":"扩散模型加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/diffusion-acceleration","wordCount":1609,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"扩散模型加速\">扩散模型加速</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>扩散模型的推理速度是其最主要的工程瓶颈。标准 DDPM 需要 1000 步采样才能生成一张图像，即使在 GPU 上也需要数十秒。这与 GAN 的单步生成形成鲜明对比。扩散模型加速研究的目标是在尽可能少的采样步数下保持生成质量，核心方法包括高效 ODE/SDE 求解器、知识蒸馏和一步生成模型三大方向。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[扩散加速方法] --&gt; B[高效求解器]&#10;    A --&gt; C[知识蒸馏]&#10;    A --&gt; D[一致性模型]&#10;    B --&gt; E[DDIM]&#10;    B --&gt; F[DPM-Solver]&#10;    B --&gt; G[Euler / Heun]&#10;    C --&gt; H[渐进蒸馏]&#10;    C --&gt; I[引导蒸馏]&#10;    D --&gt; J[一致性训练]&#10;    D --&gt; K[潜在一致性]\">graph TD\n    A[扩散加速方法] --&gt; B[高效求解器]\n    A --&gt; C[知识蒸馏]\n    A --&gt; D[一致性模型]\n    B --&gt; E[DDIM]\n    B --&gt; F[DPM-Solver]\n    B --&gt; G[Euler / Heun]\n    C --&gt; H[渐进蒸馏]\n    C --&gt; I[引导蒸馏]\n    D --&gt; J[一致性训练]\n    D --&gt; K[潜在一致性]</pre><p>加速方法的选择取决于质量-速度权衡需求。高效求解器将步数从 1000 降至 20-50 步，适合大多数应用；蒸馏方法进一步压缩到 4-8 步，适合对延迟敏感的场景；一致性模型实现 1-2 步生成，适合实时交互应用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>采样步数</th>\n<th>质量损失</th>\n<th>需要额外训练</th>\n<th>代表工作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DDPM</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n<td>无（基线）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Ho et al. 2020</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DDIM</td>\n<td>50-100</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Song et al. 2021</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DPM-Solver</td>\n<td>10-25</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Lu et al. 2022</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进蒸馏</td>\n<td>4-8</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Salimans 2022</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性模型</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Song et al. 2023</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCM</td>\n<td>2-4</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Luo et al. 2023</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDXL Turbo</td>\n<td>1-4</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Sauer et al. 2023</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ddim-与确定性采样\">DDIM 与确定性采样</h2><p>DDIM（Denoising Diffusion Implicit Models）是扩散模型加速的开创性工作。它将 DDPM 的马尔可夫采样过程推广为非马尔可夫过程，在保持相同训练目标的前提下，允许使用更大的步长进行采样。DDIM 的关键洞见是：前向过程不一定需要是马尔可夫的，只要边际分布 q(xₜ|x₀) 保持不变，就可以设计不同的采样路径。</p>\n<p>DDIM 的采样公式为：xₜ₋₁ = √ᾱₜ₋₁ · x̂₀(xₜ) + √(1-ᾱₜ₋₁-σₜ²) · ε_θ(xₜ, t) + σₜεₜ。当 σₜ=0 时，采样过程完全确定性，给定初始噪声总是生成相同的图像。这一性质使得 DDIM 支持在隐空间中进行有意义的插值和编辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;&#10;class DDIMSampler:&#10;    def __init__(self, model, scheduler, n_steps=50):&#10;        self.model = model&#10;        self.scheduler = scheduler&#10;        total_steps = len(scheduler.alpha_bars)&#10;        self.timesteps = torch.linspace(total_steps - 1, 0, n_steps + 1).long()&#10;&#10;    @torch.no_grad()&#10;    def sample(self, shape, device, eta=0.0):&#10;        x = torch.randn(shape, device=device)&#10;        for i in range(len(self.timesteps) - 1):&#10;            t = self.timesteps[i]&#10;            t_prev = self.timesteps[i + 1]&#10;            t_batch = torch.full((shape[0],), t, device=device, dtype=torch.long)&#10;            noise_pred = self.model(x, t_batch)&#10;            ab_t = self.scheduler.alpha_bars[t]&#10;            ab_prev = self.scheduler.alpha_bars[t_prev] if t_prev &gt;= 0 else torch.tensor(1.0)&#10;            x0_pred = (x - (1 - ab_t).sqrt() * noise_pred) / ab_t.sqrt()&#10;            sigma = eta * ((1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t) * (1 - ab_t / ab_prev)).sqrt()&#10;            dir_xt = (1 - ab_prev - sigma ** 2).sqrt() * noise_pred&#10;            x = ab_prev.sqrt() * x0_pred + dir_xt&#10;            if sigma &gt; 0:&#10;                x += sigma * torch.randn_like(x)&#10;        return x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DDIMSampler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model, scheduler, n_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total_steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scheduler.alpha_bars)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timesteps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.linspace(total_steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).long()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @torch.no_grad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, shape, device, eta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(shape, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timesteps) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timesteps[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            t_prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timesteps[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            t_batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.full((shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],), t, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.long)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            noise_pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model(x, t_batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ab_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.scheduler.alpha_bars[t]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ab_prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.scheduler.alpha_bars[t_prev] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t_prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.tensor(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            x0_pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_t).sqrt() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise_pred) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_t.sqrt()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_prev) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_t) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_prev)).sqrt()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            dir_xt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).sqrt() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise_pred</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_prev.sqrt() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x0_pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dir_xt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn_like(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DDIM 的 eta 参数控制采样的随机性：eta=0 为完全确定性（ODE），eta=1 退化为 DDPM。中间值提供了确定性和随机性之间的连续谱。实践中，确定性采样（eta=0）在少步数下通常质量更好，因为随机噪声在步数不足时无法被有效消除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dpm-solver-与高阶数值方法\">DPM-Solver 与高阶数值方法</h2><p>DPM-Solver 将扩散采样重新表述为求解常微分方程，并应用高阶数值方法来提高收敛速度。核心观察是：DDIM 等价于一阶 ODE 求解器（欧拉法），而通过使用多步方法或高阶泰勒展开，可以在更少步数内达到更高精度。</p>\n<p>DPM-Solver 利用了扩散 ODE 的特殊结构——解的半线性形式——设计了一族专用求解器。一阶 DPM-Solver 等价于 DDIM，二阶和三阶版本通过多步预测修正（predictor-corrector）策略显著提高了精度。DPM-Solver++ 进一步在数据预测（x₀-prediction）空间中操作，对大引导强度更加稳定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 求解器精度对比&#10;        A[1000 步 DDPM] --&gt; B[基线质量]&#10;        C[50 步 DDIM] --&gt; D[接近基线]&#10;        E[20 步 DPM-Solver-2] --&gt; F[接近基线]&#10;        G[10 步 DPM-Solver-3] --&gt; H[轻微下降]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 求解器精度对比\n        A[1000 步 DDPM] --&gt; B[基线质量]\n        C[50 步 DDIM] --&gt; D[接近基线]\n        E[20 步 DPM-Solver-2] --&gt; F[接近基线]\n        G[10 步 DPM-Solver-3] --&gt; H[轻微下降]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from diffusers import DPMSolverMultistepScheduler, StableDiffusionPipeline&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;pipe = StableDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5&quot;, torch_dtype=torch.float16&#10;).to(&quot;cuda&quot;)&#10;&#10;pipe.scheduler = DPMSolverMultistepScheduler.from_config(&#10;    pipe.scheduler.config,&#10;    algorithm_type=&quot;dpmsolver++&quot;,&#10;    solver_order=2,&#10;    use_karras_sigmas=True,&#10;)&#10;&#10;image = pipe(&#10;    &quot;a beautiful landscape painting&quot;,&#10;    num_inference_steps=20,&#10;    guidance_scale=7.5,&#10;).images[0]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DPMSolverMultistepScheduler, StableDiffusionPipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).to(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cuda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pipe.scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DPMSolverMultistepScheduler.from_config(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pipe.scheduler.config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    algorithm_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dpmsolver++\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    solver_order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    use_karras_sigmas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipe(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"a beautiful landscape painting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_inference_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    guidance_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).images[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Karras 噪声调度（也称 σ 调度）是另一个重要的加速技巧。它根据信噪比的变化规律重新分配采样时间点，使得在信噪比变化较快的区域分配更多采样步骤，而在变化平缓的区域减少步骤。这种自适应调度在 10-25 步范围内显著优于均匀调度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渐进蒸馏与知识迁移\">渐进蒸馏与知识迁移</h2><p>渐进蒸馏（Progressive Distillation）通过将教师模型的两步采样压缩为学生模型的一步采样，迭代地将步数减半。第一轮蒸馏将 1024 步教师压缩为 512 步学生，第二轮将 512 步压缩为 256 步，以此类推。经过 10 轮迭代，最终得到只需 1 步的学生模型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;def progressive_distillation_step(teacher, student, x0, scheduler, optimizer):&#10;    batch_size = x0.shape[0]&#10;    t = torch.randint(0, scheduler.n_steps // 2, (batch_size,), device=x0.device)&#10;    t_teacher_start = t * 2&#10;    t_teacher_mid = t * 2 + 1&#10;    noise = torch.randn_like(x0)&#10;    x_start = scheduler.add_noise(x0, t_teacher_start, noise)&#10;    with torch.no_grad():&#10;        noise_pred_1 = teacher(x_start, t_teacher_start)&#10;        x_mid = scheduler.step(x_start, t_teacher_start, noise_pred_1)&#10;        noise_pred_2 = teacher(x_mid, t_teacher_mid)&#10;        x_target = scheduler.step(x_mid, t_teacher_mid, noise_pred_2)&#10;    noise_pred_student = student(x_start, t)&#10;    x_student = scheduler.step_student(x_start, t, noise_pred_student)&#10;    loss = F.mse_loss(x_student, x_target)&#10;    optimizer.zero_grad()&#10;    loss.backward()&#10;    optimizer.step()&#10;    return loss.item()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> progressive_distillation_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(teacher, student, x0, scheduler, optimizer):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    batch_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x0.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scheduler.n_steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (batch_size,), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x0.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t_teacher_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t_teacher_mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    noise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn_like(x0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler.add_noise(x0, t_teacher_start, noise)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        noise_pred_1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teacher(x_start, t_teacher_start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x_mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler.step(x_start, t_teacher_start, noise_pred_1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        noise_pred_2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teacher(x_mid, t_teacher_mid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x_target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler.step(x_mid, t_teacher_mid, noise_pred_2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    noise_pred_student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> student(x_start, t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x_student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler.step_student(x_start, t, noise_pred_student)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.mse_loss(x_student, x_target)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.zero_grad()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.step()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss.item()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Guided Distillation 解决了 CFG 在蒸馏中的问题。标准 CFG 需要双重前向传播，这在蒸馏后的少步模型中成本尤其高。通过在蒸馏阶段将 CFG 的效果烘培到学生模型中，推理时只需单次前向传播。SDXL Turbo 和 SD Turbo 使用了对抗蒸馏（Adversarial Distillation），结合对抗损失和得分蒸馏损失，在 1-4 步内实现接近完整模型的质量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>蒸馏方法</th>\n<th>步数</th>\n<th>训练成本</th>\n<th>质量保持</th>\n<th>是否需要 CFG</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渐进蒸馏</td>\n<td>4-8</td>\n<td>高（多轮迭代）</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引导蒸馏</td>\n<td>4-8</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>否（烘培）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对抗蒸馏</td>\n<td>1-4</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>很好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCM</td>\n<td>2-4</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>很好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一致性模型与单步生成\">一致性模型与单步生成</h2><p>一致性模型（Consistency Models）由 Song 等人在 2023 年提出，基于一个关键约束：概率流 ODE 轨迹上的所有点应该映射到相同的起点（x₀）。这意味着模型 f_θ(xₜ, t) 对于同一条 ODE 轨迹上的任意 t 值都应该输出相同的结果。这个一致性约束允许模型在单步内直接预测 x₀，而不需要迭代去噪。</p>\n<p>Latent Consistency Model（LCM）将一致性模型应用于隐空间扩散，结合了隐空间的计算效率和一致性模型的单步生成能力。LCM 从预训练的 Stable Diffusion 模型通过一致性蒸馏得到，训练成本远低于从头训练。LCM-LoRA 进一步将一致性蒸馏与 LoRA 微调结合，只需几十 MB 的适配器即可将任意 SD 模型转化为 2-4 步模型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from diffusers import DiffusionPipeline&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;pipe = DiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;SimianLuo/LCM_Dreamshaper_v7&quot;, torch_dtype=torch.float16&#10;).to(&quot;cuda&quot;)&#10;&#10;image = pipe(&#10;    prompt=&quot;a beautiful sunset over the ocean&quot;,&#10;    num_inference_steps=4,&#10;    guidance_scale=1.0,&#10;).images[0]&#10;&#10;from diffusers import LCMScheduler&#10;&#10;base_pipe = DiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5&quot;, torch_dtype=torch.float16&#10;).to(&quot;cuda&quot;)&#10;base_pipe.scheduler = LCMScheduler.from_config(base_pipe.scheduler.config)&#10;base_pipe.load_lora_weights(&quot;latent-consistency/lcm-lora-sdv1-5&quot;)&#10;&#10;image = base_pipe(&#10;    &quot;a photo of a mountain landscape&quot;,&#10;    num_inference_steps=4,&#10;    guidance_scale=1.5,&#10;).images[0]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DiffusionPipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"SimianLuo/LCM_Dreamshaper_v7\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).to(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cuda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipe(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a beautiful sunset over the ocean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_inference_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    guidance_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).images[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LCMScheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">base_pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).to(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cuda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">base_pipe.scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LCMScheduler.from_config(base_pipe.scheduler.config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">base_pipe.load_lora_weights(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latent-consistency/lcm-lora-sdv1-5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_pipe(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"a photo of a mountain landscape\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_inference_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    guidance_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).images[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一致性模型在实时应用中有巨大潜力：1-2 步生成使得交互式图像编辑、实时预览和流式视频生成成为可能。然而，极少步数下的生成质量仍然不及完整采样，尤其在细节丰富度和多样性方面。实践中，4 步 LCM 是质量与速度的最佳平衡点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((扩散加速))&#10;    高效求解器&#10;      DDIM 确定性采样&#10;      DPM-Solver 高阶方法&#10;      Karras 噪声调度&#10;    知识蒸馏&#10;      渐进蒸馏&#10;      引导蒸馏&#10;      对抗蒸馏&#10;    一致性模型&#10;      一致性约束&#10;      LCM 隐空间一致性&#10;      LCM-LoRA 适配&#10;    实时生成&#10;      1-4 步生成&#10;      交互式编辑&#10;      流式视频\">mindmap\n  root((扩散加速))\n    高效求解器\n      DDIM 确定性采样\n      DPM-Solver 高阶方法\n      Karras 噪声调度\n    知识蒸馏\n      渐进蒸馏\n      引导蒸馏\n      对抗蒸馏\n    一致性模型\n      一致性约束\n      LCM 隐空间一致性\n      LCM-LoRA 适配\n    实时生成\n      1-4 步生成\n      交互式编辑\n      流式视频</pre><ul>\n<li>DDIM 通过非马尔可夫过程实现确定性采样，是扩散加速的基础方法</li>\n<li>DPM-Solver 利用高阶数值方法将采样步数降至 10-25 步，配合 Karras 调度效果更佳</li>\n<li>渐进蒸馏通过迭代步数减半实现 4-8 步生成，对抗蒸馏进一步压缩至 1-4 步</li>\n<li>一致性模型通过 ODE 轨迹一致性约束实现单步生成，LCM 将其应用于隐空间扩散</li>\n<li>LCM-LoRA 以极低成本将任意 SD 模型转化为少步模型，是当前最实用的加速方案</li>\n<li>加速方法的选择需根据应用场景在质量、速度和训练成本之间权衡</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"扩散模型加速","id":"扩散模型加速"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DDIM 与确定性采样","id":"ddim-与确定性采样"},{"level":2,"text":"DPM-Solver 与高阶数值方法","id":"dpm-solver-与高阶数值方法"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进蒸馏与知识迁移","id":"渐进蒸馏与知识迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性模型与单步生成","id":"一致性模型与单步生成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"条件引导机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/conditioning-guidance"},"next":{"title":"GAN 基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae/gan-fundamentals"}}